// 'this' and class names resolve like variables.
// A reserved word is not a variable - without this `new<Integer> Object[3]`
// (cannot.create.array.with.type.arguments) read as the comparison chain
// `new < Integer > Object[3]`. `this` and `super` ARE resolved like variables
// here, which is what this grammar's field access is built on.
VarRef      <~~ push(makeVarRef(up.in)) ~~>
